          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "advisor",
            text: _("Master, you are gravely injured!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("So it seems..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("Perhaps it would be a suitable end. The orcs were the ones who provoked this journey of mine. Would it not be fitting for them to end my quest as well?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "advisor",
            text: _("There is another way, master. Remember the book!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("Yes... yes. The book. That half-rotten, tattered tome which I gave my blood and soul for. I forsook my people, my family, my home... to follow that damned necromancer! And in the end, he betrayed me too, just like Drogan, just like Dela..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("Everyone has betrayed me. I am alone. All that is left..."),
          },
