            x: 27,
            y: 30,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Fake_Mal_Keshar",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mal Keshar",
            text: _("The blood is drained and the flesh is stripped. The bone remains, waiting to be reanimated. A necromancer’s most basic weapon is that, the puppet body of a skeleton."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mal Keshar",
            text: _("... but that is not what I am looking at, is it? This is... <i>my</i> face. This is what I have become..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Fake Mal Keshar",
            text: _("A skeleton, yourself."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mal Keshar",
            text: _("A skeleton — a puppet for Darken Volk’s manipulation, yes."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Fake Mal Keshar",
            text: _("A puppet of your own machinations."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mal Keshar",
            text: _("I..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Fake Mal Keshar",
            text: _("From the outset, deep down, you knew. If you followed this path, they would never accept you. Yet, you manipulated yourself into believing the opposite. You could not face the truth."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mal Keshar",
            text: _("But I was right. My logic was sound. My reasoning was flawless. They should have accepted me..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Fake Mal Keshar",
            text: _("A puppet shackled by the limitations of your own feelings. No matter its faultlessness, logic could not have displaced the reality of your world. A culture of preconception supplanting even the instinct for survival."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mal Keshar",
            text: _("Enough of this."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Fake Mal Keshar",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_terrain",
            terrain: "Wog",
            cells: "27,30",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
