            time: 1000,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_terrain",
            terrain: "Urb",
            cells: "29,31",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Fake_Mal_Keshar",
            type: "Lich",
            side: 4,
            x: 29,
            y: 31,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Fake_Mal_Keshar",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Fake Mal Keshar",
            text: _("This is what you have become. A decaying soul chained within the puppet form of a skeleton."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mal Keshar",
            text: _("A rotten soul? I was never concerned with such things to begin with. When you are slain by orcs and decompose into nothing but a maggot-eaten carcass, no ‘soul’ is going to be of any use."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Fake Mal Keshar",
            text: _("Better to sacrifice the spirit and live, than to die with dignity?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mal Keshar",
            text: _("Dignity in death is a notion contrived of by fools. It is an assertion of lies, told by humans to comfort themselves in the face of an immutable force. But not I. By sacrificing my soul, I have conquered death and will live on past all those who tried to destroy me."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Fake Mal Keshar",
            text: _("For what purpose? You will persist on, bitter and alone, until the end of time?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mal Keshar",
            text: _("..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
